      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "After EAC, further moderation is the last thing we need. The current block/mute system gives the agency to player, we have the freedom to decide what we don’t want to hear. Do not take this choice away from us.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
