      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Absolutely not, letting a robot handle moderation is not the way, it will have so many false triggers from different languages and cultural differences, and interacting with different people unrestricted is why people play vrchat, I don't know what you're doing to attract so much toxicity towards yourself because me and my friends don't experience the kind of toxicity you describe.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
