      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "ToxMod moderates everything like it's an elementary school playground where nobody's allowed to use swear words or imply something slightly derogatory (inadvertently or not).  It caused plenty issues in CoD and GTA.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
