  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-05-31T01:50:32.344Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Please consider implementing ToxMod into VRChat.\nVideo: https://www.modulate.ai/tox-mod\n# What's the problem?\nPublic worlds are great for making friends. But it's easy to get overwhelmed by homophobes, racists and other bigots. Especially for new VRChat players.\n# What's ToxMod?\nToxMod is a voice moderation tool. It detects when someone's toxic and notifies VRChat's moderators.\n# Proposed implementation\nEnable ToxMod for the biggest public instances, to make them safer.\nAs a world creator, I'd appreciate being able to keep my visitors safe, too.\n# Other implementations\n[Rec Room](https://blog.recroom.com/posts/2021/11/19/ensuring-be-excellent-to-each-other) and [PokerStars VR](https://www.pokerstars.de/poker/ps-vr/privacy/) both use ToxMod, in public instances only. The feedback I found online was mostly positive.",
